# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore - amibot_server (C++17 + ONNX Runtime + GGML / Whisper / Llama)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Modelos Pesados de IA (Excluidos de Git, sincronizados via SCP al VPS)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
model/
models/
**/model/
**/models/
**/*.gguf
model/*.bin
models/*.bin
*.bin
!libraries/tts_comms/voices/*.bin
!resources/tts_comms/voices/*.bin
**/tts_onnx/
onnx-community/
*.onnx

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Datos Sensibles, Secretos, Credenciales y Tokens
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*.secret
*.secrets
*.password
*.passwords
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.cer
*.crt
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*credential*
*token*
auth*.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
